Changes to DG made in August-October 1997
-----------------------------------------

This file lists only the most important changes. A complete listing can
be found under "What's New" in the online help.

- New
  - Mesh editing capability.
  - Improved working with templates.
  - Improved working with chords.
  - Requirements for the output file can be loosened by the user.
  
- Interface
  - "Variables" dialog boxes restructured, new functionality added.
  - "Mark" tool can now mark within a rectangle.
  - Ability to delete marked objects added.
  - "Layer label" flag for variables.

- Bugfixes
  - Torn-off menus sometimes caused a coredump.
  - Many memory leaks fixed.
  - Carre-specific errors in the output file fixed.
